{"nbformat":4,"nbformat_minor":0,"metadata":{"colab":{"provenance":[{"file_id":"14sdrqX4K5KRy9xLeg2eCpWXhoREDiai2","timestamp":1775779530294},{"file_id":"1dWQPX_vsd68tXkHoVI9x0k34xQdo5vnN","timestamp":1775762045787}],"mount_file_id":"1KD51R_C1U5NZZqi-KNnOUornNVLUJCc0","authorship_tag":"ABX9TyOhzSDXfN0rZewAPWcchTMQ"},"kernelspec":{"name":"python3","display_name":"Python 3"},"language_info":{"name":"python"}},"cells":[{"cell_type":"markdown","source":["# **Forecasting: Tasa de Finalización de la Educación Secundaria Básica (ambos sexos) en México**\n","\n","Este dataset contiene estadísticas globales de la UNESCO sobre la tasa de finalización de la educación secundaria básica (ambos sexos). Este indicador es importante porque permite ver qué tan bien los sistemas educativos logran que los estudiantes terminen sus estudios.\n","\n","Aunque el dataset original incluye datos de diversos países desde el año 2000 hasta inicios de 2024, este análisis se centra específicamente en el caso de México. El objetivo es documentar la evolución histórica del sistema educativo mexicano, identificando periodos de avance o estancamiento. A través de esta información, buscamos construir un modelo de predicción (forecasting) que permita proyectar la evolución de esta tasa en el futuro y detectar posibles brechas educativas para orientar la toma de decisiones."],"metadata":{"id":"tTh6lLFR8bDd"}},{"cell_type":"code","source":["# Manipulación y tratamiento de datos\n","import pandas as pd\n","import numpy as np\n","\n","# Gráficos\n","import matplotlib.pyplot as plt\n","import seaborn as sns\n","\n","#Modelos Estadísticos y Clásicos\n","from statsmodels.tsa.arima.model import ARIMA\n","from prophet import Prophet # Nos ayudará a detectar estacionalidades en el mercado.\n","\n","#Métricas de evaluación (para medir qué tan bueno es el modelo)\n","from sklearn.metrics import mean_squared_error, mean_absolute_error\n","\n","#Preprocesamiento y Deep Learning\n","from sklearn.preprocessing import MinMaxScaler\n","# Tensorflow y Keras son plataformas que utilizaremos para construir los modelos Deep Leraning (LSTM y Transformers)\n","import tensorflow as tf\n","from tensorflow.keras.models import Sequential\n","from tensorflow.keras.layers import Dense, LSTM, Dropout\n","from tensorflow.keras import layers, models\n","\n","\n","# Configuraciones usadas para que las gráficas se vean de alta calidad\n","%matplotlib inline\n","plt.rcParams['figure.figsize'] = (12, 6)\n","sns.set_style('whitegrid')"],"metadata":{"id":"Ga0wyh0_8loL"},"execution_count":null,"outputs":[]},{"cell_type":"markdown","source":["**OBTENCIÓN DEL DATA SET: Tasa de Finalización Secundaria Básica (2000-2024)**"],"metadata":{"id":"OVAdmo5MyIPL"}},{"cell_type":"code","source":["import zipfile\n","\n","#Definimos la ruta del archivo ZIP\n","path_zip = '/content/drive/MyDrive/2026_Arianna_y_Barbara/Datasets /Desempeño Educativo/indicator-data-export_CR.2.zip'\n","\n","#Abrimos el zip y cargamos los archivos necesario\n","with zipfile.ZipFile(path_zip, 'r') as z:\n","  with z.open('indicator-data-export_CR.2/data.csv') as f:\n","    df = pd.read_csv(f)\n","\n","df_full = df.rename(columns={\n","    'geoUnit': 'Country',\n","    'value': 'Completion Rate (%)'\n","})\n","\n","\n","#Filtrado de países\n","df = df_full[df_full['Country'] == 'MEX'].copy()\n","\n","#Formato de tiempo\n","df['year'] = pd.to_datetime(df['year'], format='%Y')\n","df.set_index('year', inplace=True)\n","\n","\n","#Limpieza de datos\n","df = df[['Country', 'Completion Rate (%)']]\n","df.columns = df.columns.str.strip()\n","df.dropna(subset=['Completion Rate (%)'], inplace=True)\n","df = df.sort_index()\n","\n","print(\"Dataset cargado exitosamente. Primeras filas:\")\n","df.head()\n","\n","\n","\n","df.head()"],"metadata":{"colab":{"base_uri":"https://localhost:8080/","height":256},"id":"99rDKVyvsRk4","executionInfo":{"status":"ok","timestamp":1775859167420,"user_tz":360,"elapsed":2243,"user":{"displayName":"ARIANNA MONSERRA